1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,281
By the pattern of thickening there are three kinds.

2
00:00:03,281 --> 00:00:07,161
Angular, thickened at the corners, as in Datura.

3
00:00:07,161 --> 00:00:12,278
Lamellar, thickened on the tangential walls, as in the sunflower stem.

4
00:00:12,278 --> 00:00:17,500
And lacunar, thickened round the air spaces, as in Cucurbita.

